  "solution_ref": "$f'=3x^2+2x-1=4$ → $x=1$, 접점 $(1,1)$, $k=-3$. $x<0$: $x^3+x^2+3x+3=0$ → $x=-1$. $S=\\int_{-1}^0(x^3+x^2+3x+3)dx+\\int_0^1(x^3+x^2-5x+3)dx=\\frac{19}{12}+\\frac{13}{12}=\\frac83$. $30S=80$",
